Title:          xwayland-satellite.tcz 
Description:    xwayland outside your wayland
Version:        0.8.2
Author:         Supreeeme 
Original-site:  https://github.com/Supreeeme/xwayland-satellite
Copying-policy: Mozilla Public License 2.0
Size:           2.5M
Extension_by:   aus9 
Tags:           wayland  
Comments:       xwayland-satellite grants rootless Xwayland integration to 
                any Wayland compositor implementing xdg_wm_base and viewporter. 

                The host compositor needs:
                Core interfaces (wl_output, wl_surface, wl_compositor, etc)
                xdg_shell (xdg_wm_base, xdg_surface, xdg_popup, xdg_toplevel)
                wp_viewporter - used for scaling

                Can optionally use: Linux dmabuf, XDG activation,
                XDG decoration, XDG foreign, Pointer constraints,
                Primary selection, Tablet input & Fractional scale

                This TCE is an optional TCE for niri as it can not use xwayland direct
 
